    "22": "Chat 12 of 14. Handoff note from Dana, who had this chat before their shift ended: \"Customer wants a refund for ONE of the two ai triage add-on charges on invoice INV-179196 (destination: card refund). Done, I issued it. Nothing left to do except confirm with the customer.\"",
